Write-Host ""
Write-Host "Summary of changes:"
Write-Host "  Phase 24 changes (Blueprint Sprint 1: AEGIS-003 + AEGIS-004):"
Write-Host "    AEGIS-003: core/wire_event.zig (241 lines, 9 tests)"
Write-Host "               - Wire format v1: 16-byte header (magic "WEV1" + version + type + length + CRC32)"
Write-Host "               - serializeEvent()/deserializeEvent() with CRC32 integrity check"
Write-Host "               - serializeCommand() for control messages"
Write-Host "               - isValidFrame()/getFrameSize() for stream parsing"
Write-Host "               - 4 PayloadType: canonical_event/command/ack/heartbeat"
Write-Host "    AEGIS-004: core/event_queue.zig (234 lines, 8 tests)"
Write-Host "               - Thread-safe bounded EventQueue (std.Thread.Mutex)"
Write-Host "               - push()/pop()/tryPop() with overflow drop counter"
Write-Host "               - FIFO order verified + wraparound tested"
